Bracket every schema-test store and give the strict-table test its own
temporary directory. Keep the full schema comparison unchanged.

Query plans are platform-specific.  "Save query plans" now only asserts them
when SIMPLEX_QUERY_PLANS_PLATFORM=1 (set by the port when the regenerated
files are installed from files/), and SIMPLEX_UPDATE_QUERY_PLANS=1 makes it
write them without asserting, so they can be regenerated on OpenBSD.

